name capt-of
category Package
revision 29803
shortdesc Captions on more than floats
relocated 1
longdesc Defines a command \captionof for putting a caption to something
longdesc that's not a float. Note that the caption package includes a
longdesc \captionof command that is an extension of that provided by
longdesc this package.
